{860}{}{Unfortunately, we have no current leads. However, considering Isaac's history, he's likely not too far from any location with pre-war technology.}
{861}{}{I'll begin the search immediately, Elder. Rest assured, I'll do whatever it takes to ensure the security of our bunker.}

